 "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198274438780/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2763, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2721, "last_played": 1781640723, "avatar": "ce6a0dde518d36e0ffe558064df6b3bd6333d03c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game's good.", "timestamp_created": 1777592804, "timestamp_updated": 1780787856, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533073961734771729", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32688", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 5700X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER", "vram_size": 11997}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224467081", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986223373", "personaname": "TechAss Davy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197986223373/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3312, "last_played": 1777592136, "avatar": "ede28dd5268cd51c958359a653e08444ab6a0efa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, yesterday I would have given this a thumbs up. But I have played nothing but PvE, never shot another person. Now I just got ganked twice in a row by PvP squads, which is just people who don't even know they're even in a fight getting sucker punched. I can't imagine it's even a good experience for the people that killed me, because what fun is it killing someone that isn't fighting back? Now my whole session is managing inventory and crafting instead of actually playing the game - annoying because scheduling my squad is difficult since we're all adults with lives. I guess I'm supposed to just hope the next one doesn't get wrecked too? Nah, I'll just play something else.\n\nThere's nothing wrong with making a PvP game, but be honest about it. Don't make it 90% PvE, but then every now and then you get screwed over out of the blue. This is easily fixable by just having separate playlists, but the devs apparently don't want to. Cool story, I guess do what you want, but I'm done and not going to buy any of your DLC or future games until you start being honest about what you're actually building.", "timestamp_created": 1777592562, "timestamp_updated": 1778246452, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.521577119827270508", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224466818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053277568", "personaname": "Chucho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053277568/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 13050, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5141, "last_played": 1784486165, "avatar": "1da36dba57766ebed201cdb7b3812b1471996a39"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game that caters to individual play styles very well, with constant bug fixes and revamping items/weapons", "timestamp_created": 1777592240, "timestamp_updated": 1777592240, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224466737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198393493989", "personaname": "SNUGMAN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198393493989/", "num_games_owned": 0, "nu